<title>NEW ZEALAND: Restaurant Brands makes key appointments.</title>
<headline>Restaurant Brands makes key appointments.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Restaurant Brands New Zealand Ltd said on Monday it had appointed Grant Ellis as chief financial officer and Ric Parker as purchasing manager.</p>
<p>Both will report to chief executive Jim Collier.</p>
<p>Ellis was previously with Huttons Kiwi Ltd as chief financial officer and company secretary.</p>
<p>Parker was previously purchasing manager for PepsiCo Restaurants International, South Pacific Region.</p>
<p>PepsiCo floated off its New Zealand restaurant businesses as Restaurant Brands early this month.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom +64-4 473 4746</p>
